  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of the Tree of Life with this personalized quilt set from Jeminise. Perfect for adding a touch of meaningful elegance to any bedroom, this versatile bedding also makes an ideal gift for housewarmings, weddings, or any special occasion, offering comfort and style in one thoughtful package.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Amazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design:</strong> Features the iconic Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), or King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent choice for loved ones, including mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, or any cherished individual.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 quilt, with an optional pillowcase for a complete look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional and decorative for use on a bed, as a cozy wrap while relaxing, or for indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalization Options:</strong> Features a text input option, allowing for a personalized touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
